    neither helps        n   78   gap>0   78/78    min  +8.5125  mean +12.3869

  ⚠ THE ADDITIVE PRICE IS OPTIMISTIC. add() credits each file with the full benefit
    of displacing a tier-1 file, but there is only ONE such displacement to sell: the
    second clearer displaces the OTHER tier-1 file and cannot re-earn it. Algebraically
    joint - add = ½[M(X,A)+M(X,B)+M(Y,A)+M(Y,B)] - M(X,Y) - M(A,B), i.e. CROSSED minus
    MATCHED pairings of the same four files, and E[max] pays almost nothing for pairing
    two strong files together. w60 registered +6.730e-6 and realised +1.235e-6 (w62 §4).

